HP. Formation (4) - Other creatures in this Formation have +1 STR / +1 maximum and current HP.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":6,"hp":9,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-013","name":"Tighten Ranks","type":"Spell","cost":2,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Choose one Formation. Until end of round, its printed Formation effects may treat its size as exactly 1 higher or 1 lower. This does not count as a card joining and cannot activate Disperse or a Rise as One growth trigger.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI"},{"id":"ELI-014","name":"Coordinated Strike","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Choose two creatures in the same Formation. If both attack the same enemy this round, the second attacker gains +3 STR for that combat.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI"},{"id":"ELI-015","name":"Rotate the Line","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Choose two creatures in the same Formation. Move up to 2 damage from one onto the other. This cannot reduce the receiving creature below 1 HP.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI"},{"id":"ELI-016","name":"Rally Standard","type":"Spell","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"Choose a Formation. Its creatures gain +1 STR this round; if its Formation size is 4 or greater, they gain +2 STR instead.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI"},{"id":"ELI-017","name":"Reinforce","type":"Spell","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"Summon two 1 STR / 1 HP Recruit creatures into open creature slots. Choose a Formation for each Recruit as it enters, or place it alone as Formation (1).","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI"},{"id":"ELI-018","name":"Shared Purpose","type":"Spell","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"Choose a Formation. Until end of round, the first time one creature in it gains STR or HP from another friendly card effect, every other creature in that Formation gains +1 to the same stat this round.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI"},{"id":"ELI-019","name":"Tower Shield","type":"Equip","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"+0 STR / +2 HP","rules":"Attach to a friendly Creature with no Equip. This Equip counts as 1 card in that creature's Formation. Formation (2) - Attached creature has Taunt.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","equipStr":0,"equipHp":2},{"id":"ELI-020","name":"Oathblade","type":"Equip","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"+2 STR / +0 HP","rules":"Attach to a friendly Creature with no Equip. This Equip counts as 1 card in that creature's Formation. Formation (3) - Attached creature gains +2 STR for its first combat each round.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","equipStr":2,"equipHp":0},{"id":"ELI-021","name":"Shieldmate Recruit","type":"Creature","cost":2,"resource":2,"statsText":"1/4","rules":"Formation (2) - The first combat damage dealt each round to the other creature in this Formation is reduced by 1.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":1,"hp":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-022","name":"Line Medic","type":"Creature","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"2/4","rules":"Formation (3) - At the start of your round, restore 2 HP to a creature in this Formation.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":2,"hp":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-023","name":"Paired Lancer","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"4/3","rules":"Formation (2) - Paired Lancer has +2 STR / +2 maximum and current HP.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":4,"hp":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-024","name":"Formation Engineer","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"3/6","rules":"Formation (4) - The first Equip you attach each round to a creature in this Formation costs 1 less, minimum 1.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":3,"hp":6,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-025","name":"House Champion","type":"Creature","cost":7,"resource":1,"statsText":"6/7","rules":"Formation (3) - Once per round, when another creature in this Formation would be destroyed by combat damage, deal 2 damage to House Champion. If House Champion survives, prevent 2 of that damage to the other creature.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":6,"hp":7,"legendary":false},{"id":"ELI-026","name":"High Marshal Caedryn","type":"Legendary Creature","cost":9,"resource":2,"statsText":"7/11","rules":"Formation (5+) - The first time each round an Equip joins Caedryn's Formation, draw 1 card, then put 1 card from your hand on the bottom of your deck. WE STAND TOGETHER - No Empty Place: Caedryn's Formation gains Disperse at Formation 4+ instead of 5+, and the first time each round damage is dispersed there, reduce the total damage by 2 before splitting it. RISE AS ONE. DIE AS ONE. - One Oath: the first time each round a card joins any Formation at size 3 or higher, the Rise growth for that addition is +2 STR / +2 maximum and current HP instead of +1/+1.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","str":7,"hp":11,"legendary":true},{"id":"ELI-027","name":"Drill Standard","type":"Equip","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"+1 STR / +1 HP","rules":"Attach to a friendly Creature with no Equip. This Equip counts as 1 card in that creature's Formation. Formation (4) - When Drill Standard joins this Formation, all creatures in it gain +1 STR this round.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","equipStr":1,"equipHp":1},{"id":"ELI-028","name":"Muster Horn","type":"Equip","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"+0 STR / +1 HP","rules":"Attach to a friendly Creature with no Equip. This Equip counts as 1 card in that creature's Formation. Formation (3) - At the start of your round, if you have an open creature slot, summon a 1 STR / 1 HP Recruit into this Formation. This normally changes the Formation to size 4.","faction":"Eliteborn","code":"ELI","equipStr":0,"equipHp":1},{"id":"ELI-029","name":"Banner of Seven","type":"Equip","cost":6,"resource":1,"statsText":"+1 STR / +2 HP","rules":"Attach to a friendly Creature with no Equip. This Equip counts as 1 card in that creature's Formation. Formation (5+) - Creatures in this Formati